{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down The Cube one block at a time and collect resources to improve your mining speed, health, and damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/MiningGif.gif?t=1746064491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your experience to buy special items to increase your mining efficiency such as corrosive mites, giant worms, and mining lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/Worm.gif?t=1746064491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Idle mode allows you to mine casually while performing other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/extras/IdleMode.gif?t=1746064491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the Boss Cubes in order to become the mining master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697170?t=1746064491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/70eb0fab7a4c9c7eeaf1f669cb4239c24fef0ed1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746064491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/c9953763cf6c4c4733fcea5d6c2b5b8cfdedb7e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746064491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697170/c9953763cf6c4c4733fcea5d6c2b5b8cfdedb7e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746064491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"